<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HoopSync Support</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 20px;">

    <h1>HoopSync Support</h1>

    <p>
        Welcome to HoopSync Support.
    </p>

    <h2>Need Help?</h2>

    <p>
        If you need assistance with HoopSync, have found a bug,
        or have a question about the app, please contact us.
    </p>

    <h2>For Coaches</h2>

    <p>
        HoopSync helps coaches plan practices, create plays,
        organize teams, and manage basketball programs.
    </p>

    <h2>For Players</h2>

    <p>
        HoopSync helps players create workouts, track training,
        study plays, and improve their game.
    </p>

    <h2>Subscriptions & Purchases</h2>

    <p>
        If you have questions about a HoopSync subscription or
        purchase, please contact us for assistance.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>

    <p>
        Email:
       <a href="mailto:hoopsyncconnect@gmail.com">
    hoopsyncconnect@gmail.com
</a>
    </p>

    <p>
        We will do our best to respond to support requests.
    </p>

</body>
</html>
